    <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-3">Why trust these numbers</p>
    <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Inscio is an Oracle NetSuite Solution Provider. 300+ ERP and NetSuite projects delivered, with NetSuite as our exclusive focus since 2012.</p>
